# Data Directory

This folder holds input data which is NOT committed to the repository (gitignored for size and confidentiality).

## Required files (provided separately by the assessment team):
- ``CAM 1.mp4`` to ``CAM 5.mp4`` — CCTV footage
- ``Brigade_Bangalore_*.csv`` — POS transaction records
- ``Brigade Road - Store layout.xlsx`` — store floor plan with zones
- ``sample_events.jsonl`` — reference event schema

Place these files here before running the pipeline.
"@ | Out-File -FilePath data/README.md -Encoding utf8